  "description": "Graffiti New is a display font with mural street graffiti style. The font was inspired by mural street arts and classic artwork. It has a unique and artistic graffiti style that will bring an authentic effect to your designs. This font works great for games, band covers, horror posters, mystery book covers, headlines, logos, posters, titles, etc. \nThis font is PUA encoded, which means you can access all of the glyphs and swashes with ease!",
